  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Intransitive: ⟦{電気|でんき}→電気：09780_denki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{点|つ}く (the light comes on)\n- Transitive pair: ⟦{電気|でんき}→電気：09780_denki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{点|つ}ける (to turn on the light)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{点|つ}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means \"is on\": ⟦テレビ→テレビ：01536_terebi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{点|つ}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (the TV is on), not \"is coming on.\"\n\nWRITING:\nOften written in kana, つく. Do not confuse it with ⟦{付|つ}く→付く：01960_tsuku⟧ (to stick, be attached) or ⟦{着|つ}く→着く：00680_tsuku⟧ (to arrive), which share the reading.",
